Comment: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Comment: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:38.50,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HBEC4B3&\bord0\shad0}Let's try hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.89,0:00:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave the window open like that, it doesn't matter how dumb you are, you're going to catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is still cold, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's only February.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you mention it, the convenience store had a bunch of magazines about chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe having some chocolate will warm us up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's because Valentine's Day is coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Valentine's Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,February 14th is Valentine's Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's have a Valentine's party at Yomogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why at a nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't they do that kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe somewhere else, but in Japan we just give chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah, I read that! So it'd work here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just from the girls to the boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the day when girls give boys they like chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what Valentine's is!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, lately it's gone the other way too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really don't know much, do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To the boy they like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka's been worried about something again lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really hurting her, but she's trying not to show us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think maybe we can cheer her up a little on Valentine's Day.{cheer up. the divorced woman. whose ex-husband is trying to run her off the property by using the mob. with a valentine's day party. ... yeeeeaaaahhhh, kobato, think a little bit harder.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ain't gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't even have the money for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can find work at Tirol!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go bother them tomorrow morning and get a job and earn enough for chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:05:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So by making cake at Tirol, you're going to get the materials for everyone to make chocolates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.84,0:05:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a pretty tall order.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why, what's wrong with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just for starters, working at Tirol is pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're there late every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.94,0:05:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I can help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The boss said I can come after Yomogi lets out every day until Valentine's!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best to make Valentine's Day go well!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rah, rah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato wants a Valentine's Day party here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's such a kind girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.21,0:06:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to take you up on that, but it's closing time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:06:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's already that late?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything else I can help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's only two days left until Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're working hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Want to go bring the sign in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we landed somewhere weird again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At least this time it wasn't over an ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That almost killed us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:08:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, it's a girl! There's humans here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Things that look like a bun don't talk here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Er, no, he's named Kurogane...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, and I'm Fai. This is Syaoran.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And this here is{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.31,0:08:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mocona! You can talk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It won't surprise her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! Ioryogi's a talking stuffed animal too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit, Kobato, how long are you going to screw around!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The boss is getting wo{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.97,0:08:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:09:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So this is Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Mocona! Pleased to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.05,0:09:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one from that amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're wanderers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.43,0:09:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just four people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Three people and one Mocona!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One Mocona?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's how you count Moconas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that means that Ioryogi is one Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There damn well aren't two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, Kuro, Ioryogi, your voices really sound alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:09:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Kurogane from this world is a tiny blue thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, bun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're here on vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've read about going all sorts of places on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you decided where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish we had somewhere to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have any money from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have any money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't use what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're all boys, so I guess we can just camp out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do we tell you're a guy? The color?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The cuteness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:11:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... If you don't have anywhere to stay, why not stay at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Saw that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.09,0:11:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bu... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay! I have a whole room!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But there's only one mattress...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we can all cozy up together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're so tall...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, we can split up between the blanket and the mattress!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you only have one mattress, does that mean you live alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I live with Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That makes it even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take her up on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.33,0:11:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Happy to meet you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what happens, Ioryogi will protect you. Right, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's go to Kobato's!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this really a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's gotta have something in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kuro, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know {\i1}everything{\i0} ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, wrong one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, he's just being a flake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no school today, so I've gotta go straight to Tirol!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't sleep at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato slept well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.87,0:12:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Having people here doesn't change a thing for you, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I'm leaving now. Feel free to do whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to a cake shop, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I help out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me guess, you'le looking for chocolates for Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you let us help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.61,0:12:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a great way to thank her for letting us stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's that kind of shop, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Syaoran, why don't you go with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're good at cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.47,0:13:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kuro wouldn't make a very good baker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't even try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.57,0:13:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kuro, let's look for other work, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get some cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Mocona...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hang out with Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.72,0:13:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He looks like he'll make a great friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to go along with this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're buddies, let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's your buddy!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let my cuteness carry you away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like I'd do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.24,0:13:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that guy, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One of Kobato's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm great at pretending I'm a stuffed animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Syaoran, you're so good with your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It just takes practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.19,0:14:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how much I try, I can't get the wrapping right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't try to do it all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do it bit by bit, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bit by bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And quit singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Syaoran, you guys have been wandering for a while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. But we're not going anywhere in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.19,0:14:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're traveling just to keep traveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you don't have a destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard to pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know how long we'll be able to stay in any given place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's someone waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't know when I'll be back, but she's still waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.53,0:15:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's somewhere I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must mean something really special to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or maybe there's someone there you want to be with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.55,0:16:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone I want to be with...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The person I want to be with...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.27,0:17:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We worked hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just sat there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I made a great mascot Mocona!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How'd it go, bakers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're back! The boss was really impressed by how good with his hands Syaoran is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They were really surprised by his clothes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, the clothes. We had problems with that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People kept asking if we were cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your joking about me looking like a cosplayer didn't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We only worked a day, so it's not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm happy to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, you did put us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you! I'll use it for Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.11,0:18:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to go to the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever this earring glows...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for letting us stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was only overnight, but it was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to impose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm sorry I couldn't do more for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato's an{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But she doesn't seem very confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:40.30,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,That's such a pretty light!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:43.40,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I like it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People from other worlds can't do anything but watch over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't even have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you make it to where you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.16,0:19:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those people were{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There isn't just the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's also Heaven, Hell, and the Spirit Realm. Maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.33,0:20:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope Syaoran and the others make it to the one where people are waiting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's having so much fen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.25,0:20:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato really worked hard on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... Yeah, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that funny shape, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted a star, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like a starfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.37,0:21:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A starfish!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She didn't just bring the chocolate, she also gave me some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She brought the boxes, wrapping paper, and cards, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope she's not working herself too hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.41,0:21:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Yoshio, who are you giving your chocolate to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.21,0:21:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy, Daddy, and my little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm giving mine to Mommy, and then one to Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.26,0:21:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got to give the best chocolate to the person you like the best, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.91,0:21:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, who are you giving your best one to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wonder if Kobato's gonna remember to save any for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're really running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.31,0:23:05.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,In between the things I've lost
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:11.75,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,and the things I've been able to hold on to,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.07,0:01:35.94,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.94,0:01:44.24,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.24,0:01:54.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.55,0:01:59.84,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.84,0:02:07.60,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.60,0:02:13.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.27,0:02:18.49,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.49,0:02:24.79,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.79,0:02:30.46,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.46,0:02:37.17,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.17,0:02:45.89,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.65,0:03:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... The Wanderers.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.36,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an1\fs22\shad0\fad(500,0)\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(105,384)}Next episode: "Spring's Pitter-patter."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.09,0:23:20.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Your smile falls in that gap
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.74,0:23:26.28,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like I can reach it, but I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.43,0:23:31.67,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.32,0:23:38.19,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to make you smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.19,0:23:43.66,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,My two wings weren't good enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.95,0:23:49.13,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I even have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.39,0:23:55.64,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Just smiling by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.15,0:24:00.47,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,is all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:07.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Just warming you is good enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.59,0:24:12.07,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,even though I want to embrace you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:19.30,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even with these scarred, worthless wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.30,0:24:27.91,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,right now I can smile
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs40\fnCreativeBlock BB\c&HBEC4B3&\bord0\shad0\frz8.494\pos(323,283)\frx6\fry334}Valentine's Party
